  },
  {
    "id": "s-45d649d9d84235133214-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "button",
    "zone": "ui",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "向こう12ヶ月の支払日を計算",
    "text_hash": "d6d4561ec405398e5a3c",
    "element_id": "calc"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-d47b137f790d04d0eafe-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "body",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "同じ条件でまた計算する場合は、任意でこのブラウザに保存できます。",
    "text_hash": "69603688559d2fe5be98",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-e7ed3d966264d000e22a-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "body",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "共有PCでは取引先名を入れずに使えます。",
    "text_hash": "80e92f9c3d24a8013256",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-fa9077872077945f94c5-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "body",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "別のPCには引き継がれません。",
    "text_hash": "6931e8f9edd9483e9e5d",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-efe2ab442615e2e48baa-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "button",
    "zone": "ui",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "この条件を保存",
    "text_hash": "3eac83e49199e9c8109a",
    "element_id": "save"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-110f2b3b7951543ec35b-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "button",
    "zone": "ui",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "カレンダー(.ics)",
    "text_hash": "313275c84660a197a9bf",
    "element_id": "ics"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-d13326dc4b74c8401249-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "button",
    "zone": "ui",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "CSVコピー",
    "text_hash": "217bdde92563ce535f6c",
    "element_id": "csv"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-bbdb65c6049823d9edc8-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "body",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "取り込んだカレンダー予定は自動更新されません。",
    "text_hash": "58d8257f31b703f38218",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-4192fa67f5c65d2f65a6-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "body",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "条件が変わったら、このページで再計算してください。",
    "text_hash": "54e7cf8bca5fc3206b32",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-27021abb4f0047702ac4-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "button",
    "zone": "ui",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "保存した条件をすべて消す",
    "text_hash": "284fc9d7ccf971f71a45",
    "element_id": "saved-clear"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-5b6fd71f935e658a1881-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "button",
    "zone": "ui",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "結果をコピー",
    "text_hash": "76febe2bdac062bef6d1",
    "element_id": "copy-result"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-ca9ea0587658a3ba95de-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "body",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "今月・翌月の経理を確認する →",
    "text_hash": "45736a18145c4844d024",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-80aee356c764ea50cc12-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "h2",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "よくある質問",
    "text_hash": "aac36ecc7cb2e61992cf",
    "element_id": "faq"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-76a891a449eb43a82417-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "h3",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "支払サイトとは何ですか？",
    "text_hash": "68e586c51af3a272a49a",
    "element_id": "faq-q1"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-f9d3d5982df988ad65e6-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "締め日から支払日までの猶予期間のことです。",
    "text_hash": "9b945acc22c1f9ae3e45",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-7e422a9234c1da081df4-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "「サイト30日」なら締めから約30日後の支払い(翌月末払い相当)を意味します。",
    "text_hash": "e1b51b655a4dd1e797c3",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-dbcea343053be0d63bf0-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "下請法では、物品等の受領日から60日以内の支払いが義務付けられています。",
    "text_hash": "ed82be1382d358051bb3",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-c3b83b4dd6663cdb96f6-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "h3",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "「月末締め翌月末払い」とは？",
    "text_hash": "34724275b8f949b219bd",
    "element_id": "faq-q2"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-2dabcaa124cd9614ed86-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "毎月末日までの取引をまとめて締め、翌月末日に支払う条件です。",
    "text_hash": "3fa78c411f526106aff3",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-827fc6ebf0dfed30686c-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "7月分(7/1〜7/31)なら8月31日が支払期日です。",
    "text_hash": "798592eb5621bafe88c1",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-6d246e800499d7aa8bd2-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "h3",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "支払日が土日祝のときは？",
    "text_hash": "696bd53d819c0ea28b71",
    "element_id": "faq-q3"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-834bc4df6ae72aa65dd9-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "銀行休業日のため、前営業日に前倒しするか翌営業日に後ろ倒しします。",
    "text_hash": "c9def9cd7f3887d1eb67",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-af5ff293c865bcf88761-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "契約と適用法令を確認してください。",
    "text_hash": "853e3494339c88db1c3b",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-8702195da2240405e39e-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "取適法対象取引で翌営業日に順延するには、相手との事前の書面・電磁的記録による合意が必要です。",
    "text_hash": "8153235a130e374bd46d",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-d013bb4260e4f34a12ac-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "本ツールは内閣府公表の祝日データ(2027年まで)と年末年始(12/31〜1/3)を考慮します。",
    "text_hash": "e081d9db666ef1e76650",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-e4fa51496d8b7f65c144-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "h3",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": false,
    "text": "下請法（中小受託取引適正化法）の60日ルールとは？",
    "text_hash": "d1f8365b55b1d28678ca",
    "element_id": "faq-q4"
  },
  {
    "id": "s-9ed790877b961332f876-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "物品等の受領日から60日以内の、できる限り短い期間内に支払期日を定める義務があります。",
    "text_hash": "ca88d20985a0d6ce4049",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-5aa226777ac52ccfa8d8-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "「月末締め翌々月払い」は60日を超えるおそれがある条件です。",
    "text_hash": "050f383d5827c16e4260",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-754bb9bac5de7b6b7191-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "なお下請法は令和8年1月1日施行の改正で題名が変わり、略称も「中小受託取引適正化法」になりました。",
    "text_hash": "cb3b5a8d55ed230fb9ae",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-37f2587a00556532945e-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "フリーランスへの発注ではフリーランス法の60日ルールが別にかかります。",
    "text_hash": "e3b059b01cd49236c1c5",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-5ce1685d2ae45acf3869-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "p",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "両者の違いは下請法と中小受託取引適正化法・フリーランス法の違いで解説しています。",
    "text_hash": "dc80e983ef6beb8f8b9a",
    "element_id": null
  },
  {
    "id": "s-313980f375839482f8d3-1",
    "page": "docs/shiharai-site/index.html",
    "kind": "div",
    "zone": "faq",
    "protected": true,
    "text": "この内容をXで共有",
    "text_hash": "b9fa9f72a79e0a73ce27",
    "element_id": null
  }
]
